OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FSaxophonist Jess Gillam performs
OL,12,     Flive from Wigmore Hall, and
OL,13,     FClassical Live begins a week of
OL,14,     Frecent performances from the
OL,15,     FHay-on-Wye festival, plus
OL,16,     FTchaikovsky's 5th Symphony.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Purcell
OL,18,     F1/5. Donald Macleod explores Henry
OL,19,     FPurcell's childhood in London - at
OL,20,     Fthe time a city in turmoil - and
OL,21,     FPurcell's youth as a chorister in
OL,22,     Fthe Chapel Royal.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
