OL,5,G1700 In Tune
OL,6,     FKatie welcomes composer Shirley J.
OL,7,     FThompson and The London Tango
OL,8,     FQuintet to In Tune.
OL,9,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,10,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,11,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,12,     Ffavourites, including works by
OL,13,     FJacques Offenbach, George Gershwin
OL,14,     Fand Mel Bonis.
OL,15,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,16,     FAn orchestral journey of bold
OL,17,     Foriginality from the BBC Scottish
OL,18,     FSymphony Orchestra at the
OL,19,     FAldeburgh Festival, featuring
OL,20,     Fconductor Ryan Wigglesworth and
OL,21,     Fpianist Steven Osborne.
